+## 4. Exact 18-write sequence (trace indices are zero-based)
+
+The core enforces every `(offset,value)` against the **next** list entry, consuming write/reset attempt accounting before the callback. The adapter independently limits values, permits at most one SW_RESET, checks visible SPI enable/active/pending before each write, and records a trace only after those checks/barriers (K:119–132,219–238,398–404; A:34–76).
