+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| 0 / 1 | `00c` | SW_RESET | `00000001` | Sole software-reset request; then checked VALID+RESET and `post_reset`. |
+| 1 / 2 | `004` | STATE | `00000000` | Ordinary RESET, distinct from SW_RESET; checked before base writes. |
+| 2 / 3 | `000` | CONFIG | `00000207` | I2C mini-core2, N7; both directions enabled. |
+| 3 / 4 | `020` | ERROR_FLAGS_EN | `0000003c` | Source base error-source enable; not IRQ-silent. |
+| 4 / 5 | `028` | OPERATIONAL_MASK | `00000300` | Mask input/output service sources. |
+| 5 / 6 | `408` | MASTER_CONFIG | `00000001` | V2 tags selected; then `base`. |
+| 6 / 7 | `020` | ERROR_FLAGS_EN | `00000000` | R30 polling adaptation for setup and later phases. |
+| 7 / 8 | `028` | OPERATIONAL_MASK | `00000300` | Retain service masking; differs from vendor FIFO transfer setup. |
+| 8 / 9 | `200` | MX_INPUT | `00000000` | Disable block-mode input count. |
+| 9 / 10 | `100` | MX_OUTPUT | `00000000` | Disable block-mode output count. |
+| 10 / 11 | `208` | MX_READ | `00000003` | Aggregate FIFO RX bytes, including protocol overhead; not three chip bytes. |
+| 11 / 12 | `150` | MX_WRITE | `00000009` | Aggregate FIFO TX bytes; not an output data-port write. |
+| 12 / 13 | `000` | CONFIG | `00000207` | Exact reviewed I2Cv2/N7 setup. |
