+| 14 / 15 | `408` | MASTER_CONFIG | `00000001` | Retain V2 tag selection; then `setup`. |
+| 15 / 16 | `004` | STATE | `00000001` | First RUN; may resume inherited activity; then `run`. |
+| 16 / 17 | `400` | CLK_CTL | `003e007c` | Source nominal100kHz divider **after** checked first RUN; then `clock`. |
+| 17 / 18 | `004` | STATE | `00000003` | PAUSE; then `pause` and terminal capture, with no further writes. |
