+| `guard_stop/require_observed_64byte_geometry` | IO fields outside PACK/UNPACK do not equal reviewed `a5`. Compatibility restriction, not proof of wrong capacity on this board (K:327–328; P:25). |
+| `guard_stop/prefifo_counts_not_exact` | FIFO/block count not0, or MX_READ/MX_WRITE not phase-appropriate0/0 or3/9. Read counts are observations, not occupancy certification (K:329–333). |
