+| `guard_stop/conservative_post_reset_policy` | CONFIG, MASTER, ERREN or OPMASK failed specifically the optional post-reset envelope; not an architectural reset-failure verdict (K:336–340). |
+| `guard_stop/configuration_readback_not_exact` | Base/setup/later exact CONFIG/MASTER/master-generation/mask/ERREN/IO predicate failed (K:341–345). |
+| `mmio_error/read_callback_failed` or `write_callback_failed` | Callback rejected, which may originate from outer board/GIC/time/access policy rather than a physical bus fault. A write may already have taken effect. Check `adapter_reason`, trace, first-failed access/offset; core is poisoned and skips terminal capture (K:198–238; A:54–76). |
