+Outer adapter admission/stops cover execution context/Stage1 readiness, mapping count/null windows/QUP mapping, changed board readbacks, GIC mapping and visible SPI enable/active/pending, tighter deadline/access/clock rollback, invalid write/read/delay policy, second SW_RESET and trace capacity (A:23–31,54–95,97–124,168–171; O:41–108). Initial and per-write GIC views do not establish ownership, globally exclude IRQs, or cover terminal state. This reviewer has not invoked those helpers.
